{
  "type": "doc",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "创建应用",
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "创建应用"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "attrs": {
        "spread": "false"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "attrs": {
            "label": "•",
            "listType": "bullet",
            "spread": "false"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "开发者通过认证之后即可创建应用。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "attrs": {
            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f840672936902533120.0.png",
            "alt": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "attrs": {
            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f840672936902533120.1.png",
            "alt": "image.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "点击【创建应用】，选择需要构建应用的类型。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "textAlign": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "attrs": {
                    "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f840672936902533120.2.png",
                    "alt": ""
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "attrs": {
                    "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f840672936902533120.3.png",
                    "alt": "image.png"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "ordered_list",
              "attrs": {
                "start": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "attrs": {
                    "label": "1.",
                    "listType": "ordered",
                    "spread": "false"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "通用型应用：正常调用开放接口功能的通用型套件"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "attrs": {
                        "textAlign": "left"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "本系统免登第三方：从本系统免登第三方系统的套件"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "attrs": {
                        "textAlign": "left"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "eteams令牌免登eteams：第三方系统免登本系统套件"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "attrs": {
                    "label": "4.",
                    "listType": "ordered",
                    "spread": "false"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "ecology免登eteasm: 泛微ecology系统免登泛微eteams系统"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "attrs": {
                    "label": "5.",
                    "listType": "ordered",
                    "spread": "false"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "回调集成套件：可实现流程审批节点回调通知第三方系统/接口的套件"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "根据页面提示输入信息。填写完毕之后可选择保存草稿，或者直接提交审核（审核时间为1-3个工作日）。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "私有化系统如何进行审核，分为如下几步："
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "ordered_list",
              "attrs": {
                "start": 1
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "attrs": {
                    "label": "1.",
                    "listType": "ordered",
                    "spread": "false"
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "登录租户管理平台，设置一个主租户为主管团队租户-如何设置不知的话可咨询向锟",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "strong",
                              "attrs": {}
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "attrs": {
                        "textAlign": "left"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "设置为主管团队之后，使用主管团队的管理员账号，打开开放平台后台首页-右上角有个开放平台后台管理中心，进去审核即可",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "strong",
                              "attrs": {}
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "attrs": {
                        "textAlign": "left"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "image",
                          "attrs": {
                            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f840672936902533120.4.png",
                            "alt": "image.png"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "attrs": {
                        "textAlign": "left"
                      },
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "image",
                          "attrs": {
                            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f840672936902533120.5.png",
                            "alt": ""
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "image",
                          "attrs": {
                            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f840672936902533120.6.png",
                            "alt": "image.png"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "image",
                          "attrs": {
                            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f840672936902533120.7.png",
                            "alt": ""
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "attrs": {
            "label": "•",
            "listType": "bullet",
            "spread": "false"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "应用有4种状态，待提交（保存草稿）、审核中（提交审核）、已发布（审核通过）和审核失败（审核不通过）。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "attrs": {
            "label": "•",
            "listType": "bullet",
            "spread": "false"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "其中审核中和已发布的应用只能删除，无法编辑；审核失败的应用可编辑之后重新提交审核。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "attrs": {
            "label": "•",
            "listType": "bullet",
            "spread": "false"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "只有审核通过之后，才能开始系统对接。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "textAlign": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "审核通过的应用会显示app_key和app_security，后续调用接口会用到。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "attrs": {
            "src": "{public_url}/docs/10.0.2026.0201.01/imgs/f840672936902533120.8.png",
            "alt": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
